# Slice 4 (Layer A density v1.5) fixture for 21-fixpoint-factorial.
# Combines v1 (Slices 1+2+3) with IF sugar: the 7-line BLT/PLT/MC tower
# for the Match-on-Bool becomes one line `matchBody IF nIsZero 1 mulBody`.
# Round-trip: canonical hash equals 21-fixpoint-factorial.json's.
@v=1 root=app
factT FNT [intT] intT
recurse PRC "recurse" factT
n PRC "n" intT
nIsZero APP eqInt [n 0]
nMinus1 APP sub [n 1]
recCall APP recurse [nMinus1]
mulBody APP mul [n recCall]
matchBody IF nIsZero 1 mulBody
bodyLam LAM [recurse n] matchBody
fact FIX factT bodyLam
app APP fact [5]
